Description: Regolith Linux branding for linux-onboarding
 Regolith Linux's welcome page, colour theme, featured slides and
 keyboard-shortcut practice workflows for linux-onboarding, the
 first-run onboarding tool.
 .
 Installing this package makes Regolith the active branding: on next
 launch, linux-onboarding shows Regolith's welcome page, theme and
 practice workflows instead of running unbranded. This is a reference
 implementation of the branding-package contract documented in
 linux-onboarding's docs/DISTRO-GUIDE.md, meant as a template other
 distros and desktops can copy.

